SCOPE AND THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The license above applies to the material authored by the copyright holder,
namely the Python code under Software/OT_NN/Pytorch_NN/, the documentation,
and the figures and benchmark results produced by it.

It does NOT apply to the following, which remain under their own terms and are
not the copyright holder's to relicense:

  - Software/OT_Functions/ and Software/OT_Software/
