    regarding any reuse of these files.

  - Any third-party dependency (PyTorch, gmsh, the MATLAB Engine API, and
    other packages listed in the README), which is governed by its own
    license.

If you intend to reuse any part of this repository, check which of the above
applies to the files you need.
